# Nested array alias on a constant binding

Verifies a constant accepts composed aliases for union elements, rows, and a
nested array while retaining ordinary indexing and rendering.

>>> source
type Cell = int | string
type Row = Cell[]
type Matrix = Row[]

const matrix: Matrix = [[1, "one"], [2, "two"]]
print(matrix)
print(matrix[1][0])

<<< stdout
[[1, one], [2, two]]
2

<<< stderr
